      {=hec.rss.model.ReservoirElement
        ID=3328
        FLD=_index
        I=88
        FLD=_name
        STR=Big Cliff
        FLD=_description
        STR=Big Cliff Dam and Lake (North Santiam River).  USGS gage 14180700;  NWS RFC ID BCL.  RM 58.1, DA=approx. 450 sq.mi.  Located just downstream of Detroit Reservoir.  USACE run-of-river project authorized for Power (Reregulation of flows from Detroit project).  Other uses include Recreation.Power Plant capacity provided by April Bardy - Typical range capacity used for range of elevations about normal operating elevation because ReReg dams are set to pass inflow - Spreadsheet is in shared folder. Actual capacity vs operating capacity may differ slightly. Outlet modeled as controlled outlet and not penstock because post processing of outlet allocations makes power calculations incorrect.*** Dummy spillway capacity 99999 used. Big Cliff passes inflow on a daily timestep.
