      {=hec.rss.model.ReservoirElement
        ID=4735
        FLD=_index
        I=103
        FLD=_name
        STR=Green Peter
        FLD=_description
        STR=Green Peter Dam and Lake (Middle Santiam River).  Green Peter Lake near Foster, OR.  USGS gage 14186100;  NWS RFC ID GPRO3.  RM 5.7, DA=273 sq.mi.  Located 7.0 mi. northeast of Foster.  USACE storage project authorized for Flood Control, Power, Navigation, and Irrigation.  Other uses include Fishery, Water Quality, and Recreation.Power Plant capacity provided by April Bardy  - Spreadsheet is in shared folder. Actual capacity vs operating capacity may differ slightly. Outlet modeled as controlled outlet and not penstock because post processing of outlet allocations makes power calculations incorrect.Spillway Rating curves from WM Troll Page:https://team.usace.army.mil/sites/NWP/EC/H/water_mgmt/Outlet%20Rating%20Tables/Spillway/GPR_Spillway_Rating_Table_Dec2017.xlsm?d=w0089446bf8b4464bbf51f3b916c436bbFree spill rating table used. This overestimates gated spill, but good for ResSim. Gate opening restrictions not reflected in rating table. RO rating curves from WM Troll Page:https://team.usace.army.mil/sites/NWP/EC/H/water_mgmt/Outlet%20Rating%20Tables/Regulating_Outlet/Green_Peter_1_RO_CHART_CALCULATOR.xlsx?d=w509a9431bf6e4c42a1634da21ee0d498Full open capacity is used. Gate opening restrictions not reflected in rating table.
