        FLD=_name
        STR=Blue River
        FLD=_description
        STR=Blue River Dam and Lake (Blue River).  Blue River Lake near Blue River, OR.  USGS gage 14162100;  NWS RFC ID BLUO3.  RM 1.7, DA=87.3 sq.mi.  Located 1.4 mi. north of the town of Blue River.  USACE storage project authorized for Flood Control, Navigation, and Irrigation.  Other uses include Fishery, Recreation, and Water Quality.RO rating tables from WM Troll Page: extension://efaidnbmnnnibpcajpcglclefindmkaj/https://team.usace.army.mil/sites/NWP/EC/H/water_mgmt/Outlet%20Rating%20Tables/Regulating_Outlet/BLUE-RIVER_2_RO_1132-1357.pdfSpillway rating tables from WM Troll Page:https://team.usace.army.mil/sites/NWP/EC/H/water_mgmt/Outlet%20Rating%20Tables/Spillway/BLU_Spillway_Rating_Table_Dec2017.xlsm?d=w3cb0b6d4ce364b9d8bc912bb9d4762e3*** Free Spill table used. Overestimates capacity, but good for ResSim that is more likely to reduce capacity from table.
