        FLD=_name
        STR=Fall Creek
        FLD=_description
        STR=Fall Creek Dam and Lake (Fall Creek).  Fall Creek Lake near Lowell, OR.  USGS gage 14150900;  NWS RFC ID FAL03.  RM 7.2, DA=184 sq.mi.  Located 2.2 mi. northeast of Lowell.  USACE storage project authorized for Flood Control, Navigation, and Irrigation.  Other uses include Fishery, Water Quality, and Recreation.RO rating table from WM Troll page:https://team.usace.army.mil/sites/NWP/EC/H/water_mgmt/Outlet%20Rating%20Tables/Regulating_Outlet/Fall_Creek_1_RO_CHART_CALCULATOR.xlsx?d=w35aaedd96fdf455e8c37eafc03c9d4a3Gates full open - gate opening restricitons not reflected in table.Spillway rating table from WM Troll page:https://team.usace.army.mil/sites/NWP/EC/H/water_mgmt/Outlet%20Rating%20Tables/Spillway/FAL_Spillway_Rating_Table_Dec2017.xlsm?d=w998267841b304b40975423ef1c80852cGates full open - gate opening restrictions not reflected in table.
