      {=hec.rss.model.ReservoirElement
        ID=9358
        FLD=_index
        I=138
        FLD=_name
        STR=Dexter
        FLD=_description
        STR=Dexter Dam and Lake (Middle Fork Willamette River).    NWS RFC ID DEX03.  USGS gage 14149150, RM 203.8, DA=996 sq.mi.    USACE run-of-river project authorized for Power, Flood Control, Navigation, and Irrigation.  Other uses include Recreation.Power Plant capacity provided by April Bardy - Typical range capacity used for range of elevations about normal operating elevation because ReReg dams are set to pass inflow - Spreadsheet is in shared folder. Actual capacity vs operating capacity may differ slightly. Outlet modeled as controlled outlet and not penstock because post processing of outlet allocations makes power calculations incorrect.*** Spillway dummy capacity 999999 used. Dexter passes inflow on a daily timestep.
