        FLD=_name
        STR=Lookout Point
        FLD=_description
        STR=Lookout Point Dam and Lake (Middle Fork Willamette River).  Lookout Point Lake near Lowell, OR.  USGS gage 14149000;  NWS RFC ID LOP03.  RM 206.9, DA=991 sq.mi.  Located 1.5 mi. east of Lowell.  USACE storage project authorized for Flood Control, Power, Navigation, and Irrigation.  Other uses include Fishery, Water Quality, and Recreation.Power Plant capacity provided by April Bardy -  Spreadsheet is in shared folder. Actual capacity vs operating capacity may differ slightly. Outlet modeled as controlled outlet and not penstock because post processing of outlet allocations makes power calculations incorrect.RO rating table from WM Troll page:https://team.usace.army.mil/sites/NWP/EC/H/water_mgmt/Outlet%20Rating%20Tables/Regulating_Outlet/Lookout_Point_1RO_CHART_CALCULATOR.xlsx?d=w55299ed7967a4b168a594f308f1cf11cGates full open - gate opening restrictions not reflected.Spillway rating table from WM Troll page:https://team.usace.army.mil/sites/NWP/EC/H/water_mgmt/Outlet%20Rating%20Tables/Spillway/LOP_Spillway_Rating_Table_Dec2017.xlsm?d=w2fa4cf0067d84f0a82fef5bb01bf5a9aFree flow curve used - gate opening restriction not reflected.
